# MadGraph5 batch script: e+ e- > t t~ h at LO with the top Yukawa moved
#
# Why this exact process:
#   - A cross section at a moved parameter point: the run's param card sets
#     ymt = 250 GeV (block YUKAWA, code 6) and leaves MT at 173 GeV, so the
#     t t~ h coupling moves while the top mass and every propagator stay put.
#     vibegraph integrates it with `integrate --param-card` on this run's own
#     Cards/param_card.dat.
#   - The reweight oracle's ee_tth_ymt process, beams and hypothesis (ymt250),
#     so the per-event reweight ratio and a fresh run at the card meet here.
#
# sqrt(s) = 1000 GeV > 2*MT + MH = 471 GeV so the channel is open.
generate e+ e- > t t~ h
output ee_to_tth_ymt250 -nojpeg
launch
set lpp1 0
set lpp2 0
set ebeam1 500
set ebeam2 500
set use_syst False
set yukawa 6 250
done
